---
interface Props {
  lang: string;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEN = lang === "en";
---

{/* Ebene 1: Consent-Banner */}
<div id="consent-banner" hidden role="region" aria-label={isEN ? "Cookie consent" : "Cookie-Einwilligung"}>
  <div class="cb-inner">
    <div class="cb-text">
      <strong>{isEN ? "We use cookies and similar technologies" : "Wir verwenden Cookies und \u00e4hnliche Technologien"}</strong>
      <p>
        {isEN ? (
          <>We store your choice in your browser where technically necessary. With your consent, we use Google Analytics 4 to statistically evaluate how our website is used, and Google Ads conversion tracking to measure which of our ads lead to enquiries. You can find further information in the settings and in the <a href="/en/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</>
        ) : (
          <>Wir speichern Ihre Auswahl technisch notwendig in Ihrem Browser. Mit Ihrer Einwilligung nutzen wir Google Analytics 4, um die Nutzung unserer Website statistisch auszuwerten, und das Conversion-Tracking von Google Ads, um zu messen, welche unserer Anzeigen zu Anfragen f&uuml;hren. Weitere Informationen finden Sie in den Einstellungen und in der <a href="/datenschutz">Datenschutzerkl&auml;rung</a>.</>
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cb-buttons">
      <button type="button" id="cb-accept-all">{isEN ? "Accept all" : "Alle akzeptieren"}</button>
      <button type="button" id="cb-reject-all">{isEN ? "Reject all" : "Alle ablehnen"}</button>
      <button type="button" id="cb-settings" class="cb-btn-neutral">{isEN ? "Settings" : "Einstellungen"}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{/* Ebene 2: Einstellungs-Panel (Modal) */}
<div id="consent-panel" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label={isEN ? "Cookie settings" : "Cookie-Einstellungen"}>
  <div class="cp-backdrop"></div>
  <div class="cp-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="cp-header">
      <h2 class="cp-title">{isEN ? "Cookie settings" : "Cookie-Einstellungen"}</h2>
      <button type="button" id="cp-close" aria-label={isEN ? "Close" : "Schlie\u00dfen"} class="cp-close-btn">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-body">
      <p class="cp-intro">
        {isEN ? (
          <>Here you decide whether we may use Google Analytics 4 to statistically evaluate our website and Google Ads conversion tracking to measure our ads. You can change your choice at any time via &ldquo;Cookie settings&rdquo; in the footer. The legal basis in each case is your consent under Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR. Access to or storage of information on your device is based, where required, on your consent under Section 25(1) TDDDG.</>
        ) : (
          <>Hier entscheiden Sie, ob wir Google Analytics 4 zur statistischen Auswertung unserer Website und das Conversion-Tracking von Google Ads zur Messung unserer Anzeigen verwenden d&uuml;rfen. Ihre Auswahl k&ouml;nnen Sie jederzeit &uuml;ber &bdquo;Cookie-Einstellungen&ldquo; im Footer &auml;ndern. Rechtsgrundlage ist jeweils Ihre Einwilligung nach Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. a DSGVO. Der Zugriff auf beziehungsweise die Speicherung von Informationen in Ihrem Endger&auml;t erfolgt, soweit erforderlich, auf Grundlage Ihrer Einwilligung nach &sect; 25 Abs. 1 TDDDG.</>
        )}
      </p>

      {/* Technisch notwendig */}
      <div class="cp-category">
        <div class="cp-cat-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="cp-cat-title">{isEN ? "Technically necessary" : "Technisch notwendig"}</h3>
            <span class="cp-always-active">{isEN ? "always active" : "immer aktiv"}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cp-cat-desc">
          {isEN
            ? "This storage is required so that we can respect your cookie choice. Your choice is stored locally in your browser. No data is transferred to third parties through this storage entry."
            : "Diese Speicherung ist erforderlich, damit wir Ihre Cookie-Entscheidung ber\u00fccksichtigen k\u00f6nnen. Die Entscheidung wird ausschlie\u00dflich lokal in Ihrem Browser gespeichert. Durch diesen Speichereintrag werden keine Daten an Dritte \u00fcbertragen."}
        </p>
        <details class="cp-details">
          <summary>{isEN ? "Details" : "Details"}</summary>
          <div class="cp-table-wrap">
            <table class="cp-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Entry" : "Eintrag"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Purpose" : "Zweck"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Storage location" : "Speicherort"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Duration" : "Dauer"}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>avorix_consent</code></td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "Storage of your consent choice" : "Speicherung Ihrer Consent-Entscheidung"}</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "your browser\u2019s local storage (localStorage)" : "lokaler Speicher Ihres Browsers (localStorage)"}</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "until withdrawal, deletion of browser data or a technical renewal of the consent request" : "bis zum Widerruf, zum L\u00f6schen der Browserdaten oder zu einer technischen Erneuerung der Abfrage"}</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      {/* Statistik */}
      <div class="cp-category">
        <div class="cp-cat-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="cp-cat-title">{isEN ? "Statistics" : "Statistik"}</h3>
          </div>
          <label class="cp-toggle" for="cp-statistics-toggle">
            <input type="checkbox" id="cp-statistics-toggle" />
            <span class="cp-toggle-slider"></span>
            <span class="sr-only">{isEN ? "Statistics" : "Statistik"}</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <p class="cp-cat-desc">
          {isEN
            ? "With your consent, we use Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics 4 provided by Google Ireland Limited to understand how our website is used and which content is helpful to visitors. Technical usage data, device information, event data and pseudonymous online identifiers may be processed. According to Google, IP address data from users in the EU is used to derive approximate location information and is then deleted without being logged in Google Analytics. This analysis helps us improve the website."
            : "Mit Ihrer Einwilligung nutzen wir Google Tag Manager und Google Analytics 4 der Google Ireland Limited, um zu verstehen, wie unsere Website genutzt wird und welche Inhalte f\u00fcr Besucher hilfreich sind. Dabei k\u00f6nnen technische Nutzungsdaten, Ger\u00e4teinformationen, Ereignisdaten und pseudonyme Onlinekennungen verarbeitet werden. Nach Angaben von Google werden IP-Adressdaten bei Zugriffen aus der EU zur Ableitung grober Standortinformationen verwendet und anschlie\u00dfend gel\u00f6scht, ohne in Google Analytics protokolliert zu werden. Die Auswertung hilft uns, die Website zu verbessern."}
        </p>
        <details class="cp-details">
          <summary>{isEN ? "Details" : "Details"}</summary>
          <div class="cp-table-wrap">
            <table class="cp-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Entries/data" : "Eintr\u00e4ge/Daten"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Provider" : "Anbieter"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Purpose" : "Zweck"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Duration" : "Dauer"}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>{isEN ? ", technical usage and event data" : ", technische Nutzungs- und Ereignisdaten"}</td>
                  <td>Google Ireland Limited</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "statistical reach and usage analysis" : "statistische Reichweiten- und Nutzungsanalyse"}</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "GA4 cookies under the currently used standard configuration for up to 2 years; event data in the Avorix GA4 property for 14 months" : "GA4-Cookies nach der aktuell eingesetzten Standardkonfiguration bis zu 2 Jahre; Ereignisdaten in der Avorix-GA4-Property 14 Monate"}</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      {/* Marketing */}
      <div class="cp-category">
        <div class="cp-cat-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="cp-cat-title">{isEN ? "Marketing" : "Marketing"}</h3>
          </div>
          <label class="cp-toggle" for="cp-marketing-toggle">
            <input type="checkbox" id="cp-marketing-toggle" />
            <span class="cp-toggle-slider"></span>
            <span class="sr-only">Marketing</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <p class="cp-cat-desc">
          {isEN
            ? "With your consent, we use Google Ads conversion tracking provided by Google Ireland Limited. It shows us whether someone who came to our website via one of our ads on Google then sends an enquiry, downloads a template or taps our phone number. The ad click identifier, the time and type of the action and technical device information are processed. Google does not receive your name, your email address or the content of your enquiry. We do not use remarketing."
            : "Mit Ihrer Einwilligung nutzen wir das Conversion-Tracking von Google Ads der Google Ireland Limited. Es zeigt uns, ob jemand, der über eine unserer Anzeigen bei Google auf die Website gekommen ist, anschließend eine Anfrage sendet, eine Vorlage herunterlädt oder unsere Telefonnummer antippt. Dabei werden die Kennung des Anzeigenklicks, Zeitpunkt und Art der Aktion sowie technische Geräteinformationen verarbeitet. Ihren Namen, Ihre E-Mail-Adresse oder den Inhalt Ihrer Anfrage erhält Google dabei nicht. Remarketing setzen wir nicht ein."}
        </p>
        <details class="cp-details">
          <summary>{isEN ? "Details" : "Details"}</summary>
          <div class="cp-table-wrap">
            <table class="cp-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Entries/data" : "Einträge/Daten"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Provider" : "Anbieter"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Purpose" : "Zweck"}</th>
                  <th>{isEN ? "Duration" : "Dauer"}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><code>_gcl_au</code>, <code>_gcl_aw</code>{isEN ? ", ad click identifier" : ", Kennung des Anzeigenklicks"}</td>
                  <td>Google Ireland Limited</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "Measuring whether a click on a Google ad led to an enquiry, a download or a call" : "Messung, ob ein Klick auf eine Google-Anzeige zu einer Anfrage, einem Download oder einem Anruf geführt hat"}</td>
                  <td>{isEN ? "up to 90 days" : "bis zu 90 Tage"}</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-footer">
      <button type="button" id="cp-save">{isEN ? "Save selection" : "Auswahl speichern"}</button>
      <button type="button" id="cp-accept-all">{isEN ? "Accept all" : "Alle akzeptieren"}</button>
      <button type="button" id="cp-reject-all">{isEN ? "Reject all" : "Alle ablehnen"}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* ===== Banner (Ebene 1) ===== */
  #consent-banner {
    position: fixed;
    inset-inline: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 9000;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    box-shadow: 0 -2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    padding: 16px;
  }
  #consent-banner[hidden] { display: none; }
  /* H1 (Anweisung 18): Grundfassung ist das Handy, ab 640 die Zeile.
     Vorher lag die Grenze bei 480 und damit ausserhalb der drei Grenzen. */
  .cb-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .cb-text {
    flex: 1 1 500px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .cb-text p { margin: 4px 0 0; }
  .cb-text a { color: #1a1a1a; text-decoration: underline; }
  .cb-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .cb-buttons button { width: 100%; }
  .cb-buttons button {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  #cb-accept-all, #cb-reject-all {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  #cb-accept-all:hover, #cb-reject-all:hover {
    background: #333333;
    border-color: #333333;
  }
  .cb-btn-neutral {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #9a9a9a;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .cb-btn-neutral:hover { background: #f5f5f5; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cb-inner { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; }
    .cb-buttons { flex-direction: row; }
    .cb-buttons button { width: auto; }
  }

  /* ===== Panel (Ebene 2) ===== */
  #consent-panel { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  #consent-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cp-backdrop { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
  .cp-dialog {
    position: relative;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }
  .cp-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 24px 0;
  }
  .cp-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .cp-close-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .cp-close-btn:hover { background: #f5f5f5; }
  .cp-body {
    padding: 16px 24px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .cp-intro { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a4a4a; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .cp-category {
    border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .cp-cat-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .cp-cat-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .cp-always-active {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #16a34a;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .cp-cat-desc { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4a4a4a; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .cp-details { margin-top: 8px; }
  .cp-details summary {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .cp-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 8px; }
  .cp-table {
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 12px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    color: #4a4a4a;
  }
  .cp-table th, .cp-table td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .cp-table th { background: #f9f9f9; font-weight: 600; }
  .cp-table code { font-size: 11px; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; }

  /* Toggle Switch */
  .cp-toggle { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cp-toggle input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0; }
  .cp-toggle-slider {
    width: 44px;
    height: 24px;
    background: #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 12px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .cp-toggle-slider::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    top: 3px;
    left: 3px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .cp-toggle input:checked + .cp-toggle-slider { background: #1a1a1a; }
  .cp-toggle input:checked + .cp-toggle-slider::after { transform: translateX(20px); }
  .cp-toggle input:focus-visible + .cp-toggle-slider { outline: 2px solid #1a1a1a; outline-offset: 2px; }

  /* Panel Footer */
  .cp-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 16px 24px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
  }
  .cp-footer button {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  #cp-save {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  #cp-save:hover { background: #333333; }
  #cp-accept-all {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  #cp-accept-all:hover { background: #333333; }
  #cp-reject-all {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  #cp-reject-all:hover { background: #333333; }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* Ab 640 wird aus dem Vollbild-Dialog wieder ein Kasten. */
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cp-dialog {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
      height: auto;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 32px);
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .cp-footer { flex-direction: row; }
    .cp-footer button { width: auto; }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var KEY = 'avorix_consent';
  var GTM_ID = 'GTM-TGC3HD6M';

  /* ---------- Storage helpers ---------- */

  function read() {
    try {
      var raw = localStorage.getItem(KEY);
      if (!raw) return null;
      var obj = JSON.parse(raw);
      if (!obj) return null;
      // Nur v3 gilt als vorhanden. Eintraege mit version 1 oder 2 gelten als
      // nicht vorhanden: der Banner erscheint diesen Besuchern erneut, weil die
      // Marketing-Kategorie neu hinzugekommen ist (Anweisung 53, A3).
      if (obj.version === 3 && obj.categories && typeof obj.categories.necessary === 'boolean') {
        return obj;
      }
      return null;
    } catch (e) { return null; }
  }

  function write(obj) {
    try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(obj)); } catch (e) { /* private mode */ }
  }

  function makeConsent(statistics, marketing) {
    return {
      version: 3,
      categories: { necessary: true, statistics: !!statistics, marketing: !!marketing },
      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
    };
  }

  /* ---------- Consent Mode v2 ---------- */

  function consentUpdate(c) {
    gtag('consent', 'update', {
      analytics_storage: c.statistics ? 'granted' : 'denied',
      ad_storage: c.marketing ? 'granted' : 'denied',
      ad_user_data: c.marketing ? 'granted' : 'denied',
      ad_personalization: 'denied'
    });
  }

  function loadGTM() {
    if (window.__gtmLoaded) return;
    window.__gtmLoaded = true;
    window.dataLayer.push({ 'gtm.start': new Date().getTime(), event: 'gtm.js' });
    var s = document.createElement('script');
    s.async = true;
    s.src = 'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id=' + GTM_ID;
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }

  function deleteGACookies() {
    var cookies = document.cookie.split(';');
    for (var i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {
      var name = cookies[i].split('=')[0].trim();
      if (name === '_ga' || name.indexOf('_ga_') === 0) {
        var domains = [window.location.hostname, '.' + window.location.hostname];
        for (var d = 0; d < domains.length; d++) {
          document.cookie = name + '=;expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT;path=/;domain=' + domains[d];
        }
        document.cookie = name + '=;expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT;path=/';
      }
    }
  }

  function deleteGclCookies() {
    var cookies = document.cookie.split(';');
    for (var i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {
      var name = cookies[i].split('=')[0].trim();
      if (name.indexOf('_gcl_') === 0) {
        var domains = [window.location.hostname, '.' + window.location.hostname];
        for (var d = 0; d < domains.length; d++) {
          document.cookie = name + '=;expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT;path=/;domain=' + domains[d];
        }
        document.cookie = name + '=;expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT;path=/';
      }
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Banner / Panel DOM ---------- */

  function showBanner() { var b = document.getElementById('consent-banner'); if (b) b.hidden = false; }
  function hideBanner() { var b = document.getElementById('consent-banner'); if (b) b.hidden = true; }

  var _panelTrigger = null;
  var _panelOpen = false;

  function openPanel(trigger) {
    var panel = document.getElementById('consent-panel');
    if (!panel) return;
    _panelTrigger = trigger || null;
    _panelOpen = true;
    // Populate toggles from stored consent
    var stored = read();
    var toggle = document.getElementById('cp-statistics-toggle');
    if (toggle) toggle.checked = !!(stored && stored.categories && stored.categories.statistics);
    var mToggle = document.getElementById('cp-marketing-toggle');
    if (mToggle) mToggle.checked = !!(stored && stored.categories && stored.categories.marketing);
    panel.hidden = false;
    // Set inert on body content
    var main = document.querySelector('main');
    var header = document.querySelector('header');
    var footer = document.querySelector('footer');
    var banner = document.getElementById('consent-banner');
    if (main) main.setAttribute('inert', '');
    if (header) header.setAttribute('inert', '');
    if (footer) footer.setAttribute('inert', '');
    if (banner) banner.setAttribute('inert', '');
    // Focus the close button
    var closeBtn = document.getElementById('cp-close');
    if (closeBtn) closeBtn.focus();
  }

  function closePanel() {
    var panel = document.getElementById('consent-panel');
    if (!panel) return;
    _panelOpen = false;
    panel.hidden = true;
    // Remove inert
    var main = document.querySelector('main');
    var header = document.querySelector('header');
    var footer = document.querySelector('footer');
    var banner = document.getElementById('consent-banner');
    if (main) main.removeAttribute('inert');
    if (header) header.removeAttribute('inert');
    if (footer) footer.removeAttribute('inert');
    if (banner) banner.removeAttribute('inert');
    // Return focus
    if (_panelTrigger && typeof _panelTrigger.focus === 'function') {
      _panelTrigger.focus();
    }
    _panelTrigger = null;
  }

  /* ---------- Focus trap ---------- */

  function trapFocus(e) {
    if (!_panelOpen) return;
    var dialog = document.querySelector('#consent-panel .cp-dialog');
    if (!dialog) return;
    var focusable = dialog.querySelectorAll('button, [href], input, select, textarea, [tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])');
    if (focusable.length === 0) return;
    var first = focusable[0];
    var last = focusable[focusable.length - 1];
    if (e.key === 'Tab') {
      if (e.shiftKey) {
        if (document.activeElement === first) { e.preventDefault(); last.focus(); }
      } else {
        if (document.activeElement === last) { e.preventDefault(); first.focus(); }
      }
    }
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { e.preventDefault(); closePanel(); }
  }

  /* ---------- Apply consent decision ---------- */

  function applyConsent(statistics, marketing, source) {
    var prev = read();
    var wasMarketing = !!(prev && prev.categories && prev.categories.marketing);
    var consent = makeConsent(statistics, marketing);
    write(consent);
    // Reihenfolge (A3, Punkt 4): erst consentUpdate, dann loadGTM, sonst feuern
    // die ersten Tags noch mit dem alten Stand.
    consentUpdate(consent.categories);
    if (statistics || marketing) {
      loadGTM();
    }
    if (!statistics) {
      // Statistik-Widerruf: GA-Cookies loeschen
      deleteGACookies();
      if (window.ga) { window.ga('remove'); }
    }
    if (!marketing) {
      // Marketing-Widerruf: Google-Ads-Cookies loeschen (_gcl_*)
      deleteGclCookies();
    }
    hideBanner();
    if (_panelOpen) closePanel();
    // A3, Punkt 5: nach einem Marketing-Widerruf die Seite einmal neu laden,
    // damit bereits geladene Ads-Tags sicher weg sind.
    if (wasMarketing && !marketing) {
      window.location.reload();
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Public API ---------- */

  window.avorixConsent = {
    openPanel: function (trigger) { openPanel(trigger); },
    open: function () { openPanel(null); },
    get: read
  };

  /* ---------- Init ---------- */

  function init() {
    var stored = read();
    if (stored) {
      consentUpdate(stored.categories);
      if (stored.categories.statistics || stored.categories.marketing) {
        loadGTM();
      }
      // Don't show banner
    } else {
      showBanner();
    }

    // Bind Banner buttons
    var banner = document.getElementById('consent-banner');
    if (banner && !banner.dataset.bound) {
      banner.dataset.bound = '1';
      document.getElementById('cb-accept-all').addEventListener('click', function () { applyConsent(true, true, 'banner'); });
      document.getElementById('cb-reject-all').addEventListener('click', function () { applyConsent(false, false, 'banner'); });
      document.getElementById('cb-settings').addEventListener('click', function () {
        openPanel(document.getElementById('cb-settings'));
      });
    }

    // Bind Panel buttons
    var panel = document.getElementById('consent-panel');
    if (panel && !panel.dataset.bound) {
      panel.dataset.bound = '1';
      document.getElementById('cp-close').addEventListener('click', closePanel);
      document.querySelector('#consent-panel .cp-backdrop').addEventListener('click', closePanel);
      document.getElementById('cp-accept-all').addEventListener('click', function () { applyConsent(true, true, 'panel'); });
      document.getElementById('cp-reject-all').addEventListener('click', function () { applyConsent(false, false, 'panel'); });
      document.getElementById('cp-save').addEventListener('click', function () {
        var toggle = document.getElementById('cp-statistics-toggle');
        var mToggle = document.getElementById('cp-marketing-toggle');
        applyConsent(toggle && toggle.checked, mToggle && mToggle.checked, 'panel');
      });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', trapFocus);
    }
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
  } else {
    init();
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', init);
})();
</script>
